      "id": "claim_c43e1fbe18dc45c8b831f661c46322fe",
      "statement": "NEPO exposes its REST API under the /api prefix (not /api/v1); each router file in backend/src/routes/ defines its own sub-prefix and is mounted with authMiddleware + casbinAuthz('resource'), with requireRoles(...) added only for admin-only resources where deny-by-default matters; auditLogMiddleware emits one Vietnamese audit row per mutating request and responses pass through the snake_case serializer.",
